@startuml
title Framework Agreement application through Implementation Agreement between CSP and its Customer

actor "B2B\nCustomer" as Customer
participant "CSP\nIT System\n(Solution)" as CSP
participant "Supplier\nIT System\n(Solution)" as Supplier

== 1. Manage Business Intent for 10 Sites (New SalesOpportunity) ==

Customer -> CSP : 1.1 Initialize Business Intent for 10 sites
CSP -> CSP : 1.2 Customer Intent Management

== 2. Product Offering Management ==

CSP -> CSP : 2.1 Identify BO (Best Offer) / NBO (Next Best Offer)\nregarding Business Intent (10 sites), Framework Agreement, ...
CSP -> Customer : 2.2 Proposition to Customer
Customer -> CSP : 2.3 Change configuration values and Validation (see TMFS003/2, TMFS007)
CSP -> CSP : 2.4 Check Commercial & Technical eligibility on internal assets
CSP -> Supplier : 2.5 Check Commercial & Technical eligibility on external assets
note right
  ? which API ?
  TMF679 Seems to deal only with Product Offering but not Product
  to be worked with TMFS018
end note
Supplier -> CSP : 2.6 Supplier is OK
CSP -> CSP : 2.7 Product Offering consolidation (incl. 1st quotation)
CSP -> Customer : 2.8 Proposition to Customer
note right : There can be several quotes

== 3. instanciation of Implementation Agreement (for 10 sites) ==

Customer -> CSP : 3.1 Complete and submit Order
CSP -> CSP : 3.2 Initialize Order
CSP -> CSP : 3.3 Initialize Implementation Agreement
CSP -> Supplier : 3.4 Order Supplier's assets (incl. Implementation Agreement for Customer's order)
note right
  ? which API ?
  TMF??? Supplier Order proposed in TMFS007
end note
Supplier -> CSP : 3.5 Commitment OK
CSP -> CSP : 3.6 Update Order, Implementation Agreement including Supplier's informations and commitment
CSP -> Customer : 3.7 Order and Implementation Agreement are sent validated to Customer

@enduml
